<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel - Mandates from 61,816 shareholders.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel - Mandates from 61,816 shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotunnel said on Thursday chairman Patrick Ponsolle had been mandated by 61,816 shareholders to vote on their behalf at a general meeting due to decide on a debt restructuring deal later in the day.</p>
<p>The statement gave no indication of the size of the share stakes held by individual shareholders.</p>
<p>It said 2,915 shareholders had asked for an entry card to the shareholders meeting, 9,199 had voted by mail and 69,232 had given out mandates to vote on their behalf.</p>
</text>
